            <summary type="html">
                <![CDATA[
                    View Full Brochure (PDF) Campus Club is a student-focused initiative by Sunstone,&hellip;
                ]]>
            </summary>
        <content type="html">
            <![CDATA[
                <p><img loading="lazy" src="https://	kartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/29/Screenshot-2026-11-01-023650f.png" alt="" width="392" height="531" sizes="(min-width: 760px) 660px, calc(93.18vw - 30px)" srcset="https://%20kartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/29/responsive/Screenshot-2026-11-01-023650f-xs.png 320w ,https://%20kartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/29/responsive/Screenshot-2026-11-01-023650f-sm.png 480w ,https://%20kartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/29/responsive/Screenshot-2026-11-01-023650f-md.png 768w ,https://%20kartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/29/responsive/Screenshot-2026-11-01-023650f-xl.png 1024w"></p>
<p><a href="https://	kartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/files/CC - Brochure.pdf" title="Campus Club: Brochure" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View Full Brochure (PDF)</a></p>
<div class="campus-project">
<div class="campus-details">
<p>Campus Club is a student-focused initiative by Sunstone, designed to help college students access academic support, career opportunities, professional development and community experiences.</p>
<p>I developed the complete written content for the 13-page Campus Club brochure, communicating the initiative's offerings, benefits, programmes and opportunities for students.</p>
<h3>BROCHURE CONTENT</h3>
<ul>
<li>About Us, Campus Club introduction and vision.</li>
<li>Student benefits and exclusive membership offerings.</li>
<li>Academic support and educational programmes.</li>
<li>Community engagement, events and activities.</li>
<li>Career development, placements and internship opportunities.</li>
<li>Achievements, placement highlights and student success stories.</li>
</ul>
<h3>MY CONTRIBUTION</h3>
<ul>
<li>Complete copywriting for the 13-page brochure.</li>
<li>Content development and structuring across all sections.</li>
<li>Writing programme descriptions, student benefits and promotional messaging.</li>
<li>Developing clear and engaging communication to present the Campus Club offering.</li>
</ul>
<p class="campus-credit">My responsibility was the complete written content and copywriting. The visual design and brochure layout were handled by the design team.</p>
</div>
</div>
