<div class="campaign-project">
<div class="campaign-details">
<h2>Sunstone | Campus Club – BrainBox Campaign</h2>
<p>BrainBox was a Campus Club campaign developed for college students, combining interactive quizzes, daily themes, competitions and prizes. I came up with the BrainBox campaign name and led its content development and execution, working with a team of designers to bring the campaign creatives to life.</p>
<h3>CAMPAIGN WEBSITE &amp; CONTENT</h3>
<p>Developed the written content for the BrainBox website, including campaign messaging, introductory content, participation instructions, FAQs and terms and conditions.</p>
<h3>CAMPAIGN COMMUNICATION</h3>
<p>Created copy for promotional mailers and campaign communications, including English and Hindi/Hinglish messaging to explain the quiz, participation process, prizes and engagement opportunities.</p>
<h3>MY ROLE &amp; CONTRIBUTION</h3>
<ul>
<li>Conceptualisation and naming of the BrainBox campaign.</li>
<li>Website copywriting and content development.</li>
<li>Writing promotional copy, mailers, FAQs and campaign communication.</li>
<li>Developing English and Hindi/Hinglish messaging.</li>
<li>Leading and coordinating the design team responsible for the campaign's visual creatives.</li>
<li>Managing campaign execution and coordinating its different creative requirements.</li>
</ul>
<p class="campaign-credit">My contribution covered campaign development, copywriting and creative team coordination. Visual artwork and graphic design were executed by the design team.</p>
</div>
